    "number_of_participants_randomized": 23,
    "number_of_participants_analyzed": 18,
    "dropout_reasons": "Ten patients were unable to tolerate haloperidol and therefore were dropped from the study. Two patients dropped out of the study before randomization because they changed their minds about participating in the study. Five patients (two placebo, three drug) did not complete the study for administrative or medical reasons. Of these five patients, two died (one placebo, one drug) due to medical problems unrelated to the study. The other three dropped out of the study because they changed their minds about participating.",
